  "source_gate": "UR",
  "reason": "UAT preparation cannot read the localized UR goal: the summary line 'Problem (Messlücke)' is no valid summary field and ends the AGDF Approval Summary block, so 'Ziel' and every later field are lost (AGDF_DECISION_CONTENT_INCOMPLETE, localized_content_missing:ziel).",
  "intended_change": "Reformat only the UR's localized AGDF Approval Summary into valid, unique summary fields (Problem, Lücken, Ziel, Betroffene, Umfang, Nachweise, Quellen und Abgrenzung, Abnahme, Risiken und Klärung, Risiken, Nächster Schritt). The English UR sections, scope, goal, non-goals and acceptance signals stay unchanged.",
  "sources": [
    {
